WEBVTT

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.200
Come in.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:11.440
Albus, the mirror downstairs,
there's a message.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:12.480
Close the door.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.920
It's from Credence, Newt.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.720
The summer Gellert and
I fell in love...

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:30.280
my brother fell in love as well,

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.560
with a girl from the Hollow.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.240
She was sent away.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.240
There were rumors about a child.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:41.920
Credence...

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.440
He's a Dumbledore.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:48.640
If I'd been a better friend...

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.680
to Aberforth, if I'd
been a better brother...

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:55.080
he might have confided in me.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.200
Perhaps things would
have been different,

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.760
and this boy...

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:03.200
could have been part of our
lives, part of our family.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.800
Credence can't be saved,
I know you know that.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.280
But he may yet be able to save us.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:23.680
Phoenix ash.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:27.920
The bird comes to him
because he's dying, Newt.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:30.560
I know the signs.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.680
You see...

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.600
my sister was an Obscurial.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:41.480
And like Credence, she never
learned to express her magic.

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:45.600
Over time it grew darker
and began to poison her.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:50.320
Worst of all, none of us were
capable of easing her pain.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.000
Can you tell me how it is that...

00:01:56.680 --> 00:01:58.520
or how it came to an end for her?

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:04.920
Gellert and I had made
plans to go away together.

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.520
My brother didn't approve.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.720
One night, he confronted us.

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.600
Voices were raised, threats made.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:18.000
Aberforth drew his wand,
which was foolish.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.760
I drew my wand, which
was even more foolish.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.040
Gellert just laughed.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.680
No one heard Ariana
coming down the stairs.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.920
Can't say for certain it was my...

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:39.400
spell.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:46.000
Doesn't really matter.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.400
(sighs) One minute she was there,
and the next she was gone.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.120
I'm so sorry, Albus.

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.640
But if it's of any comfort, perhaps
she was saved some pain...

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.200
Don't.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:02.240
Don't disappoint me, Newt.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:05.000
You of all people.

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:08.520
Your honesty is a gift...

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.040
even if at times a painful one.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.920
Our friends downstairs will be
tired and wanting to go home.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.120
You should... You should go.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.760
Albus, Lally said something earlier

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:42.680
about most of us being
ultimately imperfect.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:47.880
But even if we make mistakes,
terrible things...

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:51.840
we can try to make things right.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:55.880
And that's what matters...

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:00.880
trying.

